# Publish only reviewed documentation; source conversations and old HTML embed data.
/docs/**
!/docs/USER-GUIDE.md
!/docs/DATA-MANAGEMENT.md
!/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
!/docs/MAP-NOTES.md
!/docs/screenshots/
/docs/screenshots/*
